What data we need :

Driver — who was driving
Lap number — which lap of that run/session
Lap time — in seconds, or mm:ss.sss
Session — e.g. "Endurance", "Autocross", "Skidpad", or just a date/event name (so you don't accidentally mix laps from different days/setups)

